{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2efb5d9a91c2c58dfdf25a9fc0107ae91b80a5982adf34a055474cc95229a048", "ja": "（とある休日。昴と公園でキャッチボールをした後、\n手作り弁当をご馳走になってしまった……）", "zh": "（某个休息日。和昴在公园玩了传接球之后，还被她请吃了手工便当……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e08cabdf6922407564309a76cd88772b2155320c17005b712af5d7bdccbe109b", "ja": "ごちそうさま、昴。どれもすごく美味しかったよ。\nわざわざ用意してくれて、ありがとうな。", "zh": "多谢款待，昴。每一道都特别好吃。\n还特意准备了这些，谢了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "19b64067b0c23c6510d69e7f8c13d90f0528e25bca8b453964c2bd85b9d019f3", "ja": "へへっ、どういたしまして！\nにしても、まさか完食するとは思わなかったよ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿，不用客气！\n不过，没想到你居然全都吃光了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "43f9c80a249a31d402099da7fbd2e11c100b7d28fe69d0a00f40b496a917aa85", "ja": "ちょっと作りすぎちゃったかなって思ってたから、\n心配してたんだけど……。", "zh": "因为我还担心是不是做得有点太多了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1004_p", "source_sha256": "dedd3e905447c24bb747cc26038221124ad73c85debcf12a1c08c99eedc8fdf1", "ja": "はは。体を動かした後だったしね。\nそれに本当に美味しくて、つい……。", "zh": "哈哈，毕竟刚运动完嘛。而且真的很好吃，一不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "82fd768bd3f9d82d7a002ef01780f23fe00a7cb15166b851a3541a67cbe4d8a9", "ja": "サンキュ。兄ちゃんたちにも弁当は好評でさ。\n「昴の弁当食べると元気が出る！」って。", "zh": "谢啦。哥哥们也很喜欢这个便当，说：\n“吃了昴做的便当就会打起精神！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1006_p", "source_sha256": "38944b23ee9484f0a49757917ad95ea96645488b3aa3a2b42eb9980ebe82b78e", "ja": "ああ。確かに、その通りだな。\n俺もお弁当を食べて、元気になったよ！", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。\n我吃了便当之后，也打起精神来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "9b6e268c933af9a9f7263ce908910d8d13e9fb0cdbbbdb1b0979d055944b907c", "ja": "だろ～！　でも問題がひとつあってさ……。\n見た目がいつも同じ色になっちゃうんだよなー。", "zh": "对吧～！不过有个问题……看起来总是只有一种颜色啊——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "1e41540ccf4bc13e3fd0550ca05ca0a75249ad97c47c499be6223b89a521db9e", "ja": "一応、気をつけてるけど……ガッツリ系のおかずが\n多いから、どうしても茶色が多くなっちゃって。", "zh": "虽然我姑且也有注意……但因为大多是分量十足的菜，不管怎么做最后还是会变得大多是棕色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "d11c19e6492f4f4cf331ce96949f0455dc008373279a2c24968382480996df55", "ja": "もっと女の子っぽく、かわいい感じになるように、\n研究したりしなきゃな～。", "zh": "得研究一下，想办法让整体更有女孩子气、更可爱一点才行啊～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1a0be295c463be64a714e99ac90876fc6697d6a636d6dbc5b146bd594f72defb", "ja": "そうだったか？　卵焼きもあったし、\n野菜も入ってたから、彩りはあったと思うけど……。", "zh": "是这样吗？有玉子烧，里面也放了蔬菜，我觉得色彩搭配还不错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c22b828785f62fe1d0d06b50920f465a75756c2112ecc07affe330bff0ffe6a5", "ja": "盛り付けにも工夫があって。\n昴の気持ちがこもってるって感じたよ。", "zh": "摆盘也很有巧思。\n我能感受到昴倾注其中的心意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "10547d7d851f3ecdbbfb1861c75011153194590400be0fc9208bbb40e4ed8b40", "ja": "そっか。そんなに褒められると、なんか照れるな。\n……へへ♪", "zh": "这样啊。被你这么夸，还真有点不好意思。\n……嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "d60cf509f19394b8c99643ce167941434e2f33e813b03e31fc8c100f7f9cad47", "ja": "あのさ。そんな気に入ったんなら……また作ろうか？\n{$P$}の分の弁当……。", "zh": "那个，如果你那么喜欢的话……要不要我再做一份？\n给{$P$}的便当……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "949e31a927e6445314f1080b349b5fd6b47f14225c6e8183219d468ccdb93c97", "ja": "いいのか！　外食やコンビニ弁当が多いから助かるよ。\nって、これじゃ催促したみたいだな……。", "zh": "可以吗！我平时经常在外面吃饭，或者吃便利店便当，这可帮大忙了。\n等等，这样听起来好像是在催你一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "732f4e1e016e6cd9e1a5b147279eb37a75014274fa9acc11be779a18e08e3b5f", "ja": "気にすんなって！\nオレ、料理するのは嫌いじゃないし。それに……。", "zh": "别在意啦！\n我又不是讨厌做饭。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "3c95810e34d6d1bdc5b0afcad66da75701ceaa7cdd619d7d3b0835d173ab3629", "ja": "{$P$}にさ、オレの料理を食べて\nもらうの……なんか、いいなって思ったんだ。", "zh": "能让{$P$}吃我做的菜……\n总觉得，感觉挺棒的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "9a5b7411ba0a2d231d4d89a70c4f75f0354fbd5275eaf9cb0ec87c06e77bf3c2", "ja": "美味しいって言ってもらえるのも、\nすげーうれしいし……作り甲斐があるぜ！　へへっ。", "zh": "能听到你说好吃，\n我也特别开心……做这些就更有劲头了！嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8deac21b75773b542b76abf580fe8b244fba3125078bdd3b5bfab7d33a0f4af4", "ja": "ありがとう、昴。美味しいお弁当が食べられるなら、\n仕事もより頑張れそうだ！", "zh": "谢谢你，昴。要是能吃到美味的便当，工作也会更有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0444_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "b34e016222cbb0882c5200d01a985d3dbcd9dbf4d524297ca26acd5a46d085a5", "ja": "任せてよ！　{$P$}のために、\nうまい弁当用意するから、楽しみにしててくれよな♪", "zh": "交给我吧！我会为{$P$}准备好美味的便当，你就期待着吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
